  "question": "The theater management system needs to manage information about performances, actors, and venues, and record the participation of actors in each performance. Specifically:\nFor each performance, the system shall record the name, start time, end time, and venue.\nThe theater has multiple venues, each with a name, address, and seating capacity.\nThe theater also has multiple actors, each with a name, email address, and phone number.\nEach performance will invite some actors to participate.",
  "ddl": "-- Schema for database: rschema_0286\n\nCREATE TABLE `venue` (\n  `venue_id` int(11) NOT NULL AUTO_INCREMENT,\n  `name` varchar(255) NOT NULL,\n  `address` varchar(255) NOT NULL,\n  `seating_capacity` int(11) NOT NULL,\n  PRIMARY KEY (`venue_id`)\n) ENGINE=InnoDB DEFAULT CHARSET=utf8mb3;\n\nCREATE TABLE `actor` (\n  `actor_id` int(11) NOT NULL AUTO_INCREMENT,\n  `name` varchar(255) NOT NULL,\n  `email` varchar(255) NOT NULL,\n  `phone` varchar(50) NOT NULL,\n  PRIMARY KEY (`actor_id`)\n) ENGINE=InnoDB DEFAULT CHARSET=utf8mb3;\n\nCREATE TABLE `performance` (\n  `performance_id` int(11) NOT NULL AUTO_INCREMENT,\n  `name` varchar(255) NOT NULL,\n  `start_time` datetime NOT NULL,\n  `end_time` datetime NOT NULL,\n  `venue_id` int(11) NOT NULL,\n  PRIMARY KEY (`performance_id`),\n  CONSTRAINT `performance_ibfk_1` FOREIGN KEY (`venue_id`) REFERENCES `venue` (`venue_id`) ON DELETE CASCADE ON UPDATE CASCADE\n) ENGINE=InnoDB DEFAULT CHARSET=utf8mb3;\n\nCREATE TABLE `performance_actor` (\n  `performance_id` int(11) NOT NULL,\n  `actor_id` int(11) NOT NULL,\n  PRIMARY KEY (`performance_id`, `actor_id`),\n  CONSTRAINT `performance_actor_ibfk_1` FOREIGN KEY (`performance_id`) REFERENCES `performance` (`performance_id`) ON DELETE CASCADE ON UPDATE CASCADE,\n  CONSTRAINT `performance_actor_ibfk_2` FOREIGN KEY (`actor_id`) REFERENCES `actor` (`actor_id`) ON DELETE CASCADE ON UPDATE CASCADE\n) ENGINE=InnoDB DEFAULT CHARSET=utf8mb3;",
